{{!Override of the modern template's namespace page. The stock version groups
   a namespace's types under "Classes", "Structs", "Interfaces", "Enums"
   subheadings. We drop those subheadings and render one flat list of types,
   since the kind breakdown doesn't help readers find a type.}}

<h1 id="{{id}}" data-uid="{{uid}}" class="text-break">{{>partials/title}}</h1>
<div class="markdown level0 summary">{{{summary}}}</div>
<div class="markdown level0 conceptual">{{{conceptual}}}</div>
<div class="markdown level0 remarks">{{{remarks}}}</div>

{{#children}}
  {{#children}}
  <dl class="jumplist">
    <dt><xref uid="{{uid}}" altProperty="fullName" displayProperty="name"/></dt>
    <dd>{{{summary}}}</dd>
  </dl>
  {{/children}}
{{/children}}
